- How does the solution adapt to different indexing conventions (1-based vs 0-based) and handle edge cases where n < 2k-1?
- What modifications are needed if we allow adjacent blocks or change the objective function?

## Why This Is Asked
New angle: parity constraint on subarrays adds a practical twist to classic DP without changing core technique.

## Key Concepts
- DP with two dimensions (i, t)
- Ending a subarray with even length using prefix sums
- Path reconstruction and memory optimizations

## Code Example
